      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-meta">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>Andrea Aita is an information management practitioner based in London, UK. Andrea is the data controller for personal information collected through this website.</p>
      <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:andrea.aita@noeinsolutions.com">andrea.aita@noeinsolutions.com</a></p>

      <h2>2. What data we collect and why</h2>
      <p>We only collect personal data when you actively provide it to us. The table below summarises what we collect, how, and on what legal basis under UK GDPR.</p>

      <div class="privacy-table-wrap">
