      <h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services that may process your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>FormSubmit.co</strong> &mdash; receives optional checklist lead-form submissions and forwards them to us by email. Your data is processed by FormSubmit in accordance with their privacy policy.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> &mdash; fonts are loaded from Google&rsquo;s servers, which may log your IP address. See the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your data to any third party, nor do we use your information for advertising.</p>

      <h2>4. How long we keep your data</h2>
      <p>Lead-form emails are kept in our email inbox for up to two years and then deleted. We do not maintain a separate database of subscribers. BEP checklist and EIR Health Check answers stay in your browser and are not transmitted to us.</p>

      <h2>5. Your rights under UK GDPR</h2>
      <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right of access</strong> &mdash; you can request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to rectification</strong> &mdash; you can ask us to correct inaccurate data.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to erasure</strong> &mdash; you can ask us to delete your data where we have no overriding reason to retain it.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to object</strong> &mdash; you can object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to lodge a complaint</strong> &mdash; if you are not satisfied with how we handle your data, you can contact the Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ICO) at <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ico.org.uk</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:andrea.aita@noeinsolutions.com">andrea.aita@noeinsolutions.com</a>. We will respond within one month.</p>

      <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website does not set any cookies of its own. Third-party services such as Google Fonts may set their own cookies in accordance with their respective privacy policies. You can manage cookies through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected in the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
